==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|topf}}, from (western) {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|dupfen}}, {{m|goh|duppen}}. Origin unknown. Probably related to English {{m|en|dop|| a cup in which a diamond is cut}} and {{cog|nl|dop|| a little cup, a thimble}}.

